WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:13.579
"A kitten is going to stay with us," Mom said.

2
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:18.083
"A kitten is going to stay with us," Mom said.

3
00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:21.796
"Her name is Nugget."

4
00:00:21.797 --> 00:00:24.133
"Cool," Harry said.

5
00:00:24.134 --> 00:00:30.276
Emmy smiled. "I love kittens!"

6
00:00:30.277 --> 00:00:34.375
Rover barked. Woof!

7
00:00:34.376 --> 00:00:39.035
"I wonder if Rover likes kittens," Oliver said.

8
00:00:39.036 --> 00:00:43.213
"Nugget will just stay for the weekend," Mom said.

9
00:00:43.214 --> 00:00:46.486
"She belongs to Mrs. Rue."

10
00:00:46.487 --> 00:00:50.239
The next day Mrs. Rue came over.

11
00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:54.279
"This is Nugget," she said.

12
00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.542
"Thanks for watching her."

13
00:00:57.543 --> 00:01:02.135
Mrs. Rue left.

14
00:01:02.136 --> 00:01:05.475
Nugget looked up at everyone.

15
00:01:05.476 --> 00:01:09.201
She was fuzzy with big paws.

16
00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:14.128
"Aww! She's tiny," Emmy said.

17
00:01:14.129 --> 00:01:18.921
Meow! Nugget rolled over.

18
00:01:18.922 --> 00:01:23.500
She swatted Oliver's foot.

19
00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:27.912
Nugget climbed up the side of the sofa.

20
00:01:27.913 --> 00:01:32.414
Woof! Rover ran over.

21
00:01:32.415 --> 00:01:36.010
Nugget jumped and ran fast.

22
00:01:36.011 --> 00:01:38.968
Rover chased Nugget.

23
00:01:38.969 --> 00:01:41.831
"Oh no!" Emmy said.

24
00:01:41.832 --> 00:01:45.131
"Rover might hurt Nugget!"

25
00:01:45.132 --> 00:01:47.543
Mom bit her lip.

26
00:01:47.544 --> 00:01:50.747
Nugget hid under a chair.

27
00:01:50.748 --> 00:01:54.899
"Let's leave her alone," Aunt Judy said.

28
00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:59.621
"She'll come out when she's ready."

29
00:01:59.622 --> 00:02:02.362
Later Rover was sleeping.

30
00:02:02.363 --> 00:02:05.624
Nugget peeked out from under the chair.

31
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:10.276
She crept toward Rover.

32
00:02:10.277 --> 00:02:13.452
"Uh-oh," Emmy said.

33
00:02:13.453 --> 00:02:17.085
"I hope Rover doesn't hurt Nugget."

34
00:02:17.086 --> 00:02:22.375
Suddenly Nugget pounced on Rover.

35
00:02:22.376 --> 00:02:25.152
Rover tried to get up.

36
00:02:25.153 --> 00:02:28.560
Nugget pounced again!

37
00:02:28.561 --> 00:02:31.321
Emmy gasped.

38
00:02:31.322 --> 00:02:37.726
"Yikes! I hope Nugget doesn't hurt Rover!"

39
00:02:37.727 --> 00:02:40.721
Rover wagged his tail.

40
00:02:40.722 --> 00:02:44.434
He gave Nugget a big, wet kiss.

41
00:02:44.435 --> 00:02:50.452
Everyone laughed.

42
00:02:50.453 --> 00:02:57.343
Emmy smiled. "I guess they're friends now!"
